---
// src/pages/about.astro — About Hake, Growth Principles & Creator Operations
import HakeLayout from "@/layouts/HakeLayout.astro";
---

<HakeLayout
  title="About Hake — Creator Operations & Discord Architect"
  description="Learn about Hake, creator operations coordinator and Discord server architect managing top gaming communities and YouTube creators."
  activePage="about"
>
  <!-- Subpage Header -->
  <header class="subpage-header-section">
    <span class="subpage-eyebrow">ABOUT THE ARCHITECT</span>
    <h1 class="subpage-title">
      Behind The Scenes Of Fast-Growing Creators
    </h1>
    <p class="subpage-subtitle">
      Hi, I'm Hake. I specialize in Discord community architecture, bot automation, and creator workflow coordination. No corporate buzzwords—just reliable execution that keeps your community running smoothly.
    </p>

    <div class="subpage-stat-row">
      <div class="subpage-stat-pill">
        <span class="stat-dot"></span>
        <span>25+ Communities Architected</span>
      </div>
      <div class="subpage-stat-pill">
        <span class="stat-dot"></span>
        <span>100,000+ Member Reach</span>
      </div>
      <div class="subpage-stat-pill">
        <span class="stat-dot"></span>
        <span>Direct 24h Discord Access</span>
      </div>
      <div class="subpage-stat-pill">
        <span class="stat-dot"></span>
        <span>Zero Raid Incidents</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Flow -->
  <div class="subpage-content-wrap">
    
    <!-- Story & Mission Grid -->
    <section style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr; gap: 40px; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 64px;">
      
      <!-- Narrative Left -->
      <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
        <span class="subpage-eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">MY STORY &amp; MISSION</span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 18px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">
          Taking The Operational Weight Off Creators
        </h2>

        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          When a YouTube creator's channel starts blowing up, their community grows exponentially overnight. Hundreds of comments turn into thousands of Discord joins, unread DMs, and constant requests for attention.
        </p>

        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          Managing roles, setting up auto-moderation bots, resolving member appeals, scheduling upload alerts, and sorting through inbound sponsorship emails quickly turns into 4-6 hours of daily friction. That is time stolen directly from filming videos, brainstorming hooks, and creating great content.
        </p>

        <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          That's where I step in. I take that operational weight off creators' shoulders. I build clean, structured Discord servers with straightforward rules, bulletproof permissions, and automated bot systems. I help coordinate video editing handoffs so uploads stay on schedule, and I ensure your community remains a safe, welcoming, and high-energy home for fans.
        </p>

        <div style="background-color: var(--card-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;">
          <div style="width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--accent-blue); flex-shrink: 0;"></div>
          <span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-main);">
            "Great creators focus on making content. Great operations ensure everything else runs without them having to worry."
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Highlights Right -->
      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;">
        
        <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: rgba(0,102,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-blue);">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main);">Security-First Mindset</h3>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
            Every server is configured with strict permission hierarchies, multi-tier verification gates, and zero permission leaks. No unauthorized webhooks or crypto scams.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: rgba(34,197,94,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-green);">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main);">Proven Creator Track Record</h3>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
            Trusted by creators like CappuMCXD, Alex Adi XD, MC Thunder Playz, Arpan Gamzo, Not Vangid, and Sky Plays, managing over 100,000 community members.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
            <div style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: rgba(99,102,241,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--accent-purple);">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path></svg>
            </div>
            <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main);">Direct, Fast Communication</h3>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 13.5px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">
            Direct Discord DM line with guaranteed fast turnaround. You don't deal with account managers or support tickets; you talk straight to the person managing your ops.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 Growth Principles Section -->
    <section style="margin-bottom: 64px;" aria-label="Growth Principles">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 36px;">
        <span class="subpage-eyebrow">CORE PHILOSOPHY</span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 10px;">
          The 4 Principles Behind High-Retention Servers
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--text-muted);">
          Principles refined across tens of thousands of members to maximize engagement and minimize creator headaches.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 24px;">
        
        <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">01 / RETENTION FIRST</div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 10px;">Superfans Over Casual Visitors</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;">
            Casual viewers come and go with YouTube algorithms. But an active Discord server turns one-time viewers into lifelong superfans who participate in events, support sponsors, and create community memes that fuel future content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">02 / SIMPLICITY &amp; PACING</div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 10px;">Less Noise, More Meaningful Chat</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;">
            Having 60 dead channels makes a server feel abandoned. We keep categories tight (8-10 channels max), focusing conversation into lively, active spaces where new members feel immediately welcomed and compelled to participate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">03 / AUTOMATION THAT WORKS</div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 10px;">Autonomous Operations</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;">
            Your Discord should run seamlessly even when you are asleep or editing. AutoMod rules catch 99% of spam instantly, ticket tools log disputes cleanly, and alert bots push video drops with sub-second precision.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="background-color: var(--card-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 20px; padding: 32px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
          <div style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--accent-blue); margin-bottom: 10px;">04 / ZERO FLUFF</div>
          <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 10px;">No Generic AI Corporate Speak</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.65;">
            I don't boast about theoretical 'Zero Raid Security Frameworks' or inflated metrics. I use real tools, tested bot configs, and disciplined daily execution to make sure creators get tangible results they can see every single day.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Operational Tech Stack Section -->
    <section style="background-color: var(--card-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 40px; margin-bottom: 64px;">
      <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 28px;">
        <span class="subpage-eyebrow">TOOLKIT &amp; TECHNOLOGIES</span>
        <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 8px;">
          The Operational Toolset
        </h2>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted);">
          Industry-standard developer tools, automation bots, and coordination platforms utilized daily.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Discord Developer Portal</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Discord AutoMod Engine</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Custom Python Webhooks</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Discohook Embed Formatter</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Ticket Tool System</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Sapphire Moderation Bot</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Carl-bot Reaction Matrix</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Notion Creator Pipelines</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Trello Editor Workflows</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Google Sheets Analytics</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">Discord Server Insights</span>
        <span class="subpage-stat-pill">OBS &amp; Stream Alert Bridges</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bottom CTA Card -->
    <section style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--card-elevated) 0%, var(--card-bg) 100%); border: 1px solid var(--border-line); border-radius: 24px; padding: 48px; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px); font-weight: 800; color: var(--text-main); margin-bottom: 12px;">
        Let's Build Something Great Together
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size: 15px; color: var(--text-muted); max-width: 580px; margin: 0 auto 28px; line-height: 1.6;">
        Have a server that needs restructuring, or looking for reliable operations coordination? Reach out directly.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary-action" style="font-size: 16px; padding: 14px 36px;">
        <span>Get In Touch &rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </section>

  </div>
</HakeLayout>
